  "ruleText": "He-P 307.12 Procedures for Managed Care Organizations to Obtain Summary Statistics of Immunization Information on Members. The department shall provide annual summary statistics of immunization information to managed care organizations.\n\nSource. #12163, eff 5-1-17; ss by #14010, eff 6-27-24 (from He-P 307.11)",
